'''''The High Republic Adventures'' 1''' is the first issue of the [[2023]] [[Star Wars comic books|comic]] miniseries [[Star Wars: The High Republic Adventures (2023)|''Star Wars: The High Republic Adventures'']]. The issue was written by [[Daniel José Older]], illustrated by [[Harvey Tolibao]], [[Nick Brokenshire]], and [[Michael Atiyeh]], and published by [[Dark Horse Comics]] on [[December 6]], [[2023]].

==Publisher's summary==
''"Out here at the edge of the war&hellip; death surrounds us." It has been one year since the fall of Starlight. Padawan Lula Talisola and many others are missing and presumed dead. At the Almohaj Cantina, a Republican Outpost on the planet of Eriadu, Zeen mourns&hellip; and waits. When an intriguing transmission is received from Tartak Vil, a warlord on the remote moon of Bracront, Zeen, Qort, and a void-contemplating droid named 5AG3 ''[''sic'']'' must venture once more into hyperspace to repair their fractured team and, perhaps, the galaxy.''

==Opening crawl==
{{OpeningCrawl
